    "class": "gps-632355906658566805 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632355906591392405&sectionId=632355906658566805)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","label":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","default":"Choosing the Perfect Christmas Photo"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","label":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","default":"<p>The best photo for your Memobrick is one that already has meaning behind it. It could be a recent family portrait or a favorite picture from a Christmas celebration years ago.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the best results, choose a clear, high quality photo with good lighting and easily recognizable faces. Smaller Memobrick sizes work especially well with close up photos and fewer subjects, while larger sizes can accommodate more people and additional details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most importantly, choose a photo that makes you smile. The emotion behind the memory is what makes the finished keepsake truly special.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","label":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","default":"Start a New Christmas Tradition"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","label":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","default":"<p>Every family has Christmas traditions that they look forward to each year. Decorating the tree, preparing favorite recipes, watching holiday movies, exchanging gifts, and taking family photographs are all ways of making the season special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Adding a personalized Memobrick to those traditions can create another activity for everyone to enjoy. Choose a meaningful photo each Christmas, build it together, and create a collection of memories that reflects how your family grows and changes over the years.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","label":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","default":"<p><i>The most memorable Christmas gifts are not always the biggest or most expensive. They are the ones that remind us of the people we love and the moments we never want to forget.</i></p><p><i>This Christmas, turn a favorite photograph into something your loved one can build, display, and treasure for years. With Memobrick, a single photograph can become more than a gift. It can become a lasting reminder of the people, traditions, and memories that make Christmas special.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","label":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","default":"Reviews from Happy Customers"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpvwt6a599_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggpvwt6a599_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaryn_C._So_easy_to_understand_and_a_nice_relaxing_project_for_my_free_time._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpvwt6a599_alt","label":"ggpvwt6a599_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Dog"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpvwt6a599_title","label":"ggpvwt6a599_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Dog"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","label":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","label":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","default":"<p>-Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","label":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtMUhVgtLh_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggtMUhVgtLh_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Kelsey_M._I_love_these_memo_bricks_I_ordered_a_smaller_size_but_when_they_emailed_the_mockup_they_showed_me_the_difference_of_what_it_would_look_like_compared_to_the_bigger_size._I.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtMUhVgtLh_alt","label":"ggtMUhVgtLh_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Woman"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtMUhVgtLh_title","label":"ggtMUhVgtLh_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Woman"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","label":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","default":"<p>\"I love these memo bricks! I ordered a smaller size, but when they emailed the mockup they showed me the difference of what it would look like compared to the bigger size. I was offered to upgrade\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggymABV5hia_text","label":"ggymABV5hia_text","default":"<p>-Kelsey M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","label":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggViaFSxf0G_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggViaFSxf0G_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Candice_L._I_split_the_photo_in_half_so_I_could_get_2_of_the_60x20_so_I_could_fill_my_wall_more_and_its_turned_out_AMAZING.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggViaFSxf0G_alt","label":"ggViaFSxf0G_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Cat and Tiger"},{"type":"html","id":"ggViaFSxf0G_title","label":"ggViaFSxf0G_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Cat and Tiger"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","label":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;\"I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","label":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","default":"<p>-Candice L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","label":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggds0KACfpe_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggds0KACfpe_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaron_M._Excellent_customer_service_The_design_team_did_an_excellent_job_and_we_are_so_pleased_to_have_a_precious_family_picture_transformed_into_such_a_cool_art_form..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggds0KACfpe_alt","label":"ggds0KACfpe_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Family"},{"type":"html","id":"ggds0KACfpe_title","label":"ggds0KACfpe_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo of a Family"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","label":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","default":"<p>\"Excellent customer service! The design team did an excellent job and we are so pleased to have a precious family picture transformed into such a cool art form.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","label":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","default":"<p>-Aaron M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","label":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeCJTAXJN8_label","label":"ggeCJTAXJN8_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILABILITY</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiv54UBZAH_text","label":"ggiv54UBZAH_text","default":"<p><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_0","label":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_0","default":"<p><strong>Can we build Memobrick as a family?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_1","label":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_1","default":"<p><strong>What type of photo works best?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_2","label":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_2","default":"<p><strong>Can Memobrick become a Christmas tradition?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_3","label":"gg9ed-lCwIo_childItem_3","default":"<p><strong>Is Memobrick suitable as a Christmas gift?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMR-RMCKVv_text","label":"ggMR-RMCKVv_text","default":"<p>Absolutely. Building the mosaic together can be a fun Christmas activity for children, parents, grandparents, couples, and friends.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSE1tEhSGZ_text","label":"ggSE1tEhSGZ_text","default":"<p>Clear photos with good lighting and recognizable faces usually create the best results. Choose a photograph that has special meaning to you or your family.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6usRoBwvq_text","label":"gg6usRoBwvq_text","default":"<p>Yes. Families can choose a favorite photo each Christmas and build a new mosaic together, creating a collection of memories over time.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggezvP2rk77_text","label":"ggezvP2rk77_text","default":"<p>Yes. It combines a personalized keepsake with a hands on building experience, making it a meaningful alternative to ordinary Christmas gifts.</p>"}],
